  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Original fossil-form target retained: stout vase-shaped shell, strong shoulder projections and open flaring mouth. Species-informed Hystrivasum squamosum, not generic conch or another Vasum genus. [\"Accidental breakage is simplified/restored using intact areas and conspecific photo; not a restoration of exact missing fragments\", \"Fine species delimitation can be variable; do not claim a diagnostic taxonomic revision or exact biological spine count\", \"Neutral bone-beige is artistic fossil colour, not original living pattern\"] {\"units\": \"metres\", \"height\": 0.107, \"width\": 0.069, \"depth\": 0.063, \"tolerance_fraction\": 0.15, \"height_width_basis\": \"UF image2cm scale strip spans approximately92px; shell height~490px and width~316px =>106.5x68.7mm. Approximate pixel/projection scale, not precise measurement.\", \"depth_basis\": \"Inferred from conspecific five-view proportions; no direct UF thickness measurement.\", \"not_transferred\": \"Type122x90mm is not UF201603; Zell specimen unknown dimensions are not assigned a scale or museum identity.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Original fossil-form target retained: stout vase-shaped shell, strong shoulder projections and open flaring mouth. Species-informed Hystrivasum squamosum, not generic conch or another Vasum genus. [\"Accidental breakage is simplified/restored using intact areas and conspecific photo; not a restoration of exact missing fragments\", \"Fine species delimitation can be variable; do not claim a diagnostic taxonomic revision or exact biological spine count\", \"Neutral bone-beige is artistic fossil colour, not original living pattern\"] {\"units\": \"metres\", \"height\": 0.107, \"width\": 0.069, \"depth\": 0.063, \"tolerance_fraction\": 0.15, \"height_width_basis\": \"UF image2cm scale strip spans approximately92px; shell height~490px and width~316px =>106.5x68.7mm. Approximate pixel/projection scale, not precise measurement.\", \"depth_basis\": \"Inferred from conspecific five-view proportions; no direct UF thickness measurement.\", \"not_transferred\": \"Type122x90mm is not UF201603; Zell specimen unknown dimensions are not assigned a scale or museum identity.\"}"
  },
